<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns first credit 24.93 pct.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns first credit 24.93 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has assigned one of three credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     AVERAGE    </p>
<p>1.508  bln pesos 14 days  24.93</p>
<p>1.508  bln pesos 12 days</p>
<p>1.000  bln pesos  3 days</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
